<div style="display: block ; border : dashed 1px #444444 ; background :#F5F5F5 ; margin-left : auto ; margin-right : auto ; width : auto ; padding:10px">
<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><span style="font-size:140%;">You feel like you're going to have a bad time<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c5daGZ96QGU">.</a></span></p>
<p>- <em>Undertale</em></p>
