<p><br />
<br />
<br /></p>
<p>This is my entry into the 5k contest. It's a little something different and I <em>know</em> some of you are going to hate it but it was a ton of fun to write and I don't regret it even a little bit.</p>
<p>This started from me overhearing &quot;RBG is a wizard&quot; at a party last year, so there's that.</p>
<p>Image links in the header, thanks to the handful of people who read some of that. It's been a wild ride and I'm really happy with how things turned out.</p>
<p>Thank you everyone!</p>
<p><strong>SIDE NOTE</strong>: in all the excitement of the last few days I totally forgot to attribute the person who provided the absolute lynchpin to this whole thing, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/daveyoufool" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2034230); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2034230&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579795188" alt="daveyoufool" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2034230)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/daveyoufool" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2034230); return false;">daveyoufool</a></span>. I cannot even dream of being able to capture the spanko voice, but Dave has come through in the clutch everytime I've required his dark talents. Thanks Dave!</p>
<p>Preferred slots: Closest number to 5001 that hasn't already been taken. 🌵</p>

